    "title": "API-DocTest-List Ecommerce Cart Summarys-v1-spec",
    "description": "The Ecommerce Cart Summary API provides real-time insights into the aggregated contents of a user's shopping cart. This endpoint allows clients to retrieve a summary that includes total item counts, estimated costs, and any applied discounts. It is particularly useful for e-commerce platforms looking to enhance user experience by displaying relevant cart information. Typical consumers include front-end applications and customer service tools that assist in the checkout process.",
